<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89481" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσκαίω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσκαθ-κάω</span></b> : aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσέκαυσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					828
				</span></i>
			:—<i>set on fire</i> or <i>burn besides</i>,
			l.c.; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἑψόμενα</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				767a20
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν δᾷδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					9.3.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄψον προσκέκαυκε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.
					124.3
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκεύη προσκεκαυμένα</span>
			pots <i>burnt at the fire</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				939
			</span></i> (nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κεκλημένα</span>), cf.
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				381a27
			</span></i>: metaph., <i>to be in love with . . </i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσχυρῶς προσεκαύθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					4.23
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
